{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "989acbda-7062-860c-8274-c277fe7f75d5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T09:28:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yes, my name is Maria Resendes, and I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house. It's backed up again and I am just, I'm tired of it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry to hear that. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:21:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "152 Kay Street. Up the Hill, Historic Hill, you know, a couple of doors off the avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "152 Kay Street, got it. And what's it doing? Is the water sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's sitting there. Since the storm Friday and Saturday, three days now, and it hasn't gone anywhere. The apron of my driveway holds a puddle, and the whole thing slopes toward the garage door. So every time it rains the water heads right for the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, Saturday it was up to the hubcaps on my car. Now it's gone down some, but it's still a big puddle. The drain just sits there full of leaves and whatever. Nothing goes down it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you think the grate is clogged, or the pipe underneath?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:23:05-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't tell you which. I went out with a rake and cleared the top, the leaves and the muck, and it made no difference. So it's something down below. That's why I'm calling, I want somebody to come clean that drain out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:23:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a request for the catch basin to be cleaned and checked. Has anyone from the city been out there before about this one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't say what the neighbors did. I know it's been bad before, every time we get a real rain it fills up. Nobody ever seems to fix it, that's what gets me. They come, they look, and then it's the same thing the next storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I don't see a prior ticket in front of me for that address, so I'll make this one detailed. Is the water at all getting into the garage right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not right now, no. It stopped short Saturday, but it was close, maybe a couple of inches from the door track. If it rains again this week I don't know what happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that it drains toward the garage door and that it reached hubcap depth. That helps the crew prioritize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. And I'll tell you, I'm not the only one on the street. The corner down by the avenue floods too, but that's a different thing, that's the boulevard side and I don't know who handles that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's a different spot, give me the cross street and I can add it as a separate request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eh, I'd have to look. I only know it by the church. Let me deal with mine first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Can I get a phone number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0179. That's the house line, I'm usually here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0179. Got it. And it's under Resendes, R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Maria."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Maria. So the request is to clean the storm drain in front of 152 Kay Street, ponding on the driveway apron toward the garage, following the storm this past weekend. Crews are stretched thin after a storm like that, so it may take a few days, maybe into next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next week. Okay. I suppose that's what it is. I just hope it's before the next rain. Forecast says something Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag the forecast in the notes. I can't promise it's Thursday, but I'll mark it so it doesn't sit at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate that. You know, it's funny, I got a letter from my pen pal up in Canada yesterday, she asked how the winter was treating us, and I thought, well, wet, that's how."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:27:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, tell her we're wet and waiting on the drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. I'll write her back tonight. Anyway, you'll have somebody call me if they can't get to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, if there's any change we'll call that number. And if the water starts heading into the garage, call us right back and say so, and we'll bump it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Maria. Take care."
    }
  ],
